# AI tasks called directly (nothing is stored except the AI run), AI runs and reply policies.
# Rate limited per tenant and per caller (429 + Retry-After). Needs scope ai:run.

@token = PASTE-AN-ADMIN-DEV-TOKEN
@officeId = PASTE-AN-OFFICE-ID

### Classify a reply (rules first, LLM otherwise)
# @name classified
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/replies/classify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject": "Re: Shipping to Gulf Importers", "body": "Please quote 2x40HC Chennai to Rotterdam, monthly, FOB.", "office_name": "UAE", "contact_country": "AE"}

### Automatic replies never reach the LLM (source: rules)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/replies/classify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject": "Automatic reply", "body": "I am out of the office, back on 12 October."}

### Extract shipment details
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/replies/extract-shipment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body": "We ship 3x40HC of ceramic tiles from Valencia to Jebel Ali every month, CIF."}

### Draft a reply in the office's voice (not sent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/replies/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"office_id": "{{officeId}}", "body": "Sounds good, tell me more about your rates to Jeddah.", "bucket": "interested", "language": "en", "tone": "friendly"}

### Localize a template (placeholders are preserved exactly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/templates/localize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject": "Shipping to {{company.name}}", "body": "Hello {{contact.first_name|there}},\n\n{{sender.name}}", "target_language": "fr", "region": "FR"}

### AI runs (usage, latency, cost; never the email text)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/runs?task=classify_reply&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One AI run
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/runs/{{classified.response.body.ai_run_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reply policy for every bucket
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/reply-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Forward partnership questions... (conversational buckets only; admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ai/reply-policies/meeting_request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action_mode": "forward_to_owner"}

### Protective buckets are fixed (422)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ai/reply-policies/complaint
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action_mode": "draft_for_review"}
